  <h1>Lesson 43: Landing Page - Pages That Sell One Thing</h1>
  <p>One Goal, One Button, High Conversion | LearnHTMLCSSJS.com</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="tabs">
    <button id="lessonTabBtn" class="tab-btn active" onclick="showLesson()">📖 Lesson</button>
    <button id="testTabBtn" class="tab-btn" onclick="showTest()">📝 Test - 100 Marks</button>
  </div>
  <div id="lockMsg" class="lock-msg">🔒 Test is running! All tabs are locked until you submit the test or time ends.</div>

  <div id="lessonContent">
    <h2>1. Website vs Landing Page - Big Difference</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Website (Lesson 41)</th><th>Landing Page (Today)</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Goal</td><td>Many goals - Explore, read, contact</td><td>ONE goal - Buy, Sign Up, or Order</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Pages</td><td>Many pages - Home, About, Services, Contact</td><td>ONE page - Everything on one page</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Menu</td><td>Full menu - 5-6 links</td><td>No menu or 1 link - No distraction</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Buttons</td><td>Many buttons - Different goals</td><td>SAME button again and again - "Order Now"</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Example</td><td>Shop website, School website</td><td>"50% Off Biryani - Order Now" page</td></tr>
    </table>
    <div class="note"><b>Simple Rule:</b> Website = A Mall - Many shops, user wanders. Landing Page = A Single Shop Counter - One product, one price, one button - Buy Now. Clients pay MORE for landing pages because they bring sales directly.</div>
    <h2>2. LIVE DEMO - Landing Page That Sells Biryani</h2>
    <p>Notice: Same "Order Now" button 3 times, countdown, reviews, FAQ - This is how real landing pages work:</p>
    <div class="demo-card">
      <div class="land">
        <div class="land-offer">🔥 LIMITED OFFER - 50% OFF - Ends in <span id="landTimer">10:00</span> ⏰</div>
        <div class="land-hero">
          <h3 style="margin:0">🍗 Best Chicken Biryani in Lahore</h3>
          <p style="margin:8px 0">Hot, Fresh, Delivered in 30 Minutes - Or FREE!</p>
          <p style="font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:6px 0"><span style="text-decoration:line-through;opacity:.7">Rs. 600</span> &nbsp; Rs. 299 Only!</p>
          <button class="btn" style="background:white;color:#dc2626;font-size:18px;padding:12px 28px" onclick="landOrder()">Order Now - Rs. 299 🛵</button>
          <p id="landResult" style="font-weight:bold;margin-top:8px;min-height:22px"></p>
          <p style="font-size:13px;opacity:.9;margin:0">⭐ 4.9 | 2,340+ Happy Customers | Cash on Delivery</p>
        </div>
        <div class="land-grid"><div class="land-card">🔥<br><b>Fresh & Hot</b><br><span style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b">Cooked after your order</span></div><div class="land-card">🛵<br><b>30 Min Delivery</b><br><span style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b">Late = Free</span></div><div class="land-card">💯<br><b>100% Halal</b><br><span style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b">Pure ingredients</span></div></div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:0 16px"><b>⭐ What Customers Say</b><p style="color:#475569;font-size:14px">"Best biryani in Lahore! Delivered hot in 25 minutes. I order every Friday." - Fatima, Lahore</p><p style="color:#475569;font-size:14px">"Rs. 299 me itni achi biryani? I was shocked. 10/10." - Bilal, DHA</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(1)">❓ How long does delivery take? +</button><div class="faq-a" id="faq1">30 minutes in Lahore city. If late, your order is FREE.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(2)">❓ Cash on Delivery available? +</button><div class="faq-a" id="faq2">Yes! Pay cash when rider arrives. JazzCash also accepted.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(3)">❓ What if I do not like it? +</button><div class="faq-a" id="faq3">Full refund, no questions asked. Your happiness is our promise.</div></div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:0 16px 18px"><button class="btn" style="background:#dc2626;font-size:18px;padding:12px 28px" onclick="landOrder()">Order Now - Rs. 299 🛵</button></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2>3. 7 Parts of a High Conversion Landing Page</h2>
    <p>1. <b>Headline</b> - Benefit in 1 line - "Best Biryani in Lahore" not "Welcome to our site"<br>2. <b>Offer</b> - Price + Discount - Old price cut, new price big<br>3. <b>One Button - Again and Again</b> - Same "Order Now" after every section<br>4. <b>Benefits</b> - 3 cards - Fresh, Fast, Halal - Not features, benefits<br>5. <b>Social Proof</b> - Reviews + Numbers - "2,340+ Happy Customers" builds trust<br>6. <b>Urgency</b> - Countdown timer - "Ends in 10:00" - Makes user act NOW<br>7. <b>FAQ</b> - Answer fears - Delivery? Payment? Refund? - Removes last doubt</p>
    <div class="note"><b>Conversion = Visitors who buy / Total visitors x 100.</b> Normal website: 1-2%. Good landing page: 10-20%. That is why businesses pay Rs. 20,000-50,000 for ONE landing page.</div>
    <h2>4. Countdown Timer - Urgency Code</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="text">let timeLeft = 600; // 10 minutes = 600 seconds</span><br>
<span class="text">setInterval(function() {</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">timeLeft--;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">let m = Math.floor(timeLeft / 60);</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">let s = timeLeft % 60;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">document.getElementById("timer").innerText = m + ":" + (s &lt; 10 ? "0" + s : s);</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">if (timeLeft &lt;= 0) { timeLeft = 600; } // Restart - Offer never really ends</span><br>
<span class="text">}, 1000);</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>5. FAQ Toggle - Show / Hide Answer</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="text">function toggleFaq(id) {</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">let answer = document.getElementById("faq" + id);</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">answer.classList.toggle("show"); // If hidden, show. If shown, hide.</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* CSS */</span><br>
<span class="text">.faq-a { display: none; }</span><br>
<span class="text">.faq-a.show { display: block; }</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>6. Headline Formula - Copy This</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">// Bad Headline - Boring, no benefit</span><br>
<span class="text">"Welcome to Ali Biryani House"</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">// Good Headline - Benefit + Place + Speed</span><br>
<span class="text">"Best Chicken Biryani in Lahore - Delivered Hot in 30 Minutes"</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">// Formula: [Best / Fastest] + [Product] + [in Place] + [Benefit]</span><br>
<span class="text">"Best Websites in Pakistan - Ready in 3 Days - That Bring You Customers"</span><br>
<span class="text">"Learn English in 30 Days - Speak Confidently - Or Money Back"</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>7. Homework - Build a Landing Page That Sells</h2>
    <p>In Playground, build a landing page for ONE product - Choose one:</p>
    <p>1. <b>Course Landing Page</b> - "Learn Web Development in 30 Days - Rs. 999 Only - Enroll Now" - With countdown, reviews, FAQ<br>2. <b>Pizza Landing Page</b> - "Large Pizza Rs. 999 - Free Delivery - Order Now" - With offer bar, benefits, order button<br>3. <b>Your Service Landing Page</b> - "I Will Build Your Website in 3 Days - Rs. 15,000 - Order Now" - This one can bring you real clients!</p>
    <p>Must have: One headline with benefit, one price with discount, same button 3 times, countdown, 3 benefits, 2 reviews, 3 FAQs.</p>
    <div class="box"><b>Remember:</b> Landing Page = ONE goal, ONE button, ONE page | Website = Many goals, many pages | Parts = Headline + Offer + Same Button + Benefits + Reviews + Urgency + FAQ | Conversion = Buyers / Visitors x 100 | Countdown = Urgency - Act NOW | FAQ = Remove fears | Headline = Benefit, not "Welcome"</div>
    <p><b>Next Step:</b> <a href="/lesson44">Lesson 44 - Navbar & Footer</a> - Master the two parts every website shares. Sticky, dropdown, mobile menu, mega footer.</p>
    <a id="playgroundLink" class="btn" href="/playground">▶ Try it Yourself - Playground</a><br><br>
