          <div class="question"><b>Q1. What is a Landing Page?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> One page, one goal, one button - Buy / Sign Up / Order</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Many pages, many goals</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Only footer</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Only contact page</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. Website vs Landing Page - Menu?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> Website has full menu, Landing page has no menu or 1 link - No distraction</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> Both have full menu</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> Website has no menu</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> Landing page has 10 links</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. How many times should CTA button appear?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> Again and again - Same button after every section</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> Only once at bottom</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> Never</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> Only in footer</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. What is Conversion?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> Buyers / Visitors x 100</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> Visitors + Buyers</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> Visitors - Buyers</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> Only visitors</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. Why use countdown timer?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> Urgency - Makes user act NOW, not later</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> To show time only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> To make page slow</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> No reason</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q6. Why show reviews?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> Social Proof - Builds trust, others bought and liked it</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> To make page long</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> To add color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> No reason</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q7. Why add FAQ?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> Answer fears - Delivery, payment, refund - Removes last doubt</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> To add questions only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> To hide price</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> No reason</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q8. What is a good headline?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="a"> Benefit in 1 line - "Best Biryani in Lahore - Delivered Hot in 30 Min"</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="b"> "Welcome to our site"</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="c"> "Hello"</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="d"> "About Us"</label></div>
