          <div class="question"><b>Q10. What should benefits show?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="a"> Benefits - Fresh, Fast, Halal - Not just features</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="b"> Only price</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="c"> Only name</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="d"> Nothing</label></div>
